    /**
     * Returns the paint for the specified section.  This is equivalent to
     * <code>lookupSectionPaint(section, getAutoPopulateSectionPaint())</code>.
     *
     * @param key  the section key.
     *
     * @return The paint for the specified section.
     *
     * @since 1.0.3
